-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
--  CRYSTAL TOOLS v3  –  Standalone, execute sendiri
--  Fitur 1 : Die-to-Drop  → matikan karakter, semua item keluar
--  Fitur 2 : Rune Dropper → drop rune cepat via Escape (1 ms / item)
--  Fitur 3 : INSTANT Pickup → ambil LANGSUNG saat item jatuh
--            Pakai firetouchinterest + DescendantAdded event
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

local Players    = game:GetService("Players")
